# Value ladder

```mermaid
flowchart TB
  A[Open morphology audit] --> B[Reusable study packages]
  B --> C[Institutional research workspaces]
  C --> D[Observed field/simulation outcomes]
  D --> E[Validated transfer evidence]
  E --> F[Cross-agency benchmark and ontology]
  F --> G[Governed planetary analog network]
  G --> H[Interoperable infrastructure standard]
```

## Scale discipline

| Level | What is measured | Honest language |
|---|---|---|
| Prototype | Correctness, clarity, reproducibility | Public scientific prototype |
| Research | Repeat usage, expert review, protocol outcomes | Research workflow product |
| Institutional | Retention, procurement, ROI, governance | Enterprise/institutional platform |
| Network | Independent adoption and validated records | Shared evidence network |
| Infrastructure | Standards adoption and economic activity influenced | Conditional strategic infrastructure |

No arrow guarantees a valuation. Every transition requires evidence.
